ton that's still located at the bottom.\n- Now see if you can still minimize the Main Screen/Panel, though you can still switch tab but you can no longer able to open Left/Right or Bottom Docks.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A, thus, not project dependent.","closed_by":{"login":"StrangePanda0","id":114645280,"node_id":"U_kgDOBtVZIA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/114645280?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StrangePanda0","html_url":"https://github.com/StrangePanda0","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StrangePanda0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StrangePanda0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StrangePanda0/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StrangePanda0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StrangePanda0/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StrangePanda0/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StrangePanda0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StrangePanda0/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StrangePanda0/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114230/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114230/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}